OL,3,GNEWSADriver killed when car hit brick
OL,4,Awall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver was killed when her car came
OL,7,Foff the road and hit a brick wall in
OL,8,FLiverpool, police said.
OL,10,FThe 38-year-old woman was declared dead
OL,11,Fat the scene in Allerton Road, Woolton,
OL,12,Fafter her red Nissan Juke crashed just
OL,13,Fafter 23:30 BST on Friday.
OL,15,FMerseyside Police said her next of kin
OL,16,Fhad been informed and would be
OL,17,F"supported by specially trained
OL,18,Fofficers". The force has appealed for
OL,19,Fany witnesses or doorbell footage.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
